+/* 44px: ┬س┘à┘╪ش╪▓┬╗ 51x36, ┬س╪ز╪╣╪»┘è┘┬╗ 59x36, ┬س╪ص╪░┘┬╗ 55x36 ظ¤ three targets a thumb
+   keeps missing, measured by the deep self-QA at 390px. */
+.btn.tiny{padding:6px 12px;min-height:44px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:500}
+/* #c0392b measured 3.29:1 on the card ظ¤ the last WCAG failure in the app.
